    skills: [{ id: 40010, kind: 'Normal', name: "Ice Crystal Blade", desc: "Deals 100% Magic DMG to a single enemy, with a 50% chance to inflict [Slow] (SPD reduced by 20%) for 1 turn.", buffs: ["Slow"] }, { id: 40013, kind: 'Active', name: "Ice Edge Pressure", desc: "Deals 199% Magic DMG to a single enemy, with a 40% chance to inflict [Frostbite] (SPD reduced by 10%, and Erosion taken increased by 10%) for 2 turns; also has a 25% chance to [Taunt] all enemies for 1 turn.", buffs: ["Frostbite", "Erosion", "Taunt"] }, { id: 40011, kind: 'Ultimate', name: "Prism Core", desc: "Grants all allies a \"Glacier Shield\" equal to 15% of Max HP for 2 turns (DMG taken is reduced by 12% while shielded), and dispels 1 debuff from all allies.", buffs: ["Glacier Shield", "Shield"] }, { id: 40012, kind: 'Passive', name: "Watcher’s Oath", desc: "Marks the ally with the highest ATK, permanently increasing their CRIT DMG by 10%; when receiving fatal damage, immunizes against death and restores 15% HP (triggers up to 1 time per battle).", buffs: ["Mark"] }],
    description: "Evelyn Sterling is an elite agent of P.R.I.S.M.'s First Squad and the childhood friend of you. Ten years ago, the two survived the hellish Zero Land Incident.\" To protect you behind her, she awakened the \"Glacier\" mark in the face of death. From that day on, she forged herself into an unbreakable shield of frost, vowing to become the your most loyal protector on the battlefield.    To outsiders, she is a calm, elegant, and taciturn \"Ice Queen,\" absolutely and precisely obeying the your every tactical order on the battlefield. However, once the mission is over and she returns to the your side, this cold shield melts instantly, revealing a vulnerable side that is extremely dependent on you and yearns for the warmth of \"tuning.\"\"",
