    description: "Lily Fisher is P.R.I.S.M.'s most troublesome yet indispensable assault operative and infiltration expert. Born into the chaotic lower streets, she awakened the Swift Wind\" mark in the harsh environment of survival. After being recruited by P.R.I.S.M., she treats the battlefield as a giant playground, using her exceptional intuition and unparalleled speed to traverse enemy lines, making her the team's constant \"variable.\"    Lively, cheerful, and wild, she always wears a sly smile. She views life as a game of cards, enjoying using pranks and unexpected tactics to trick her opponents and sometimes her teammates. However, beneath her seemingly frivolous exterior, she harbors a unique, cat-like attachment to you, often finding pleasure in teasing him.\"",
