    description: "Suzuka is a mysterious woman from an eastern island nation. Seeking stronger opponents, she left her secluded dojo and honed her skills in the chaotic underground fighting arena of the city, where she was discovered by P.R.I.S.M. For her, language is often superfluous; fighting is her only way of communicating with the world, and proof that she will clear obstacles for you.    Simple-minded, combative, and energetic, she's a typical fighting idiot\" who believes \"strength is everything.\" She holds immense respect for the strong and thinks in a straightforward, uncompromising way. However, when faced with everyday matters outside of fighting and training, she becomes unusually clumsy and slow-witted.\"",
