    description: "Penelope is a top computer prodigy with severe social anxiety who was forcibly recruited\" along the network cables after hacking into the organization's database just for fun. Having awakened the \"Void\" Mark, she can sink her physical body into a sub-dimension, executing flawless reconnaissance while ignoring all obstacles. As long as she is provided with internet and snacks, the front line is merely a different venue for her to serve as a mastermind from behind the scenes, incisively pointing out the enemy's fatal weakness.    A lazy, trouble-averse genius with an extraordinary IQ, she constantly mutters \"what a pain.\" She usually looks half-asleep and drowsy, yet radiates an astonishing allure within her oversized sailor uniform and extremely high-cut profile. Viewing you as her sole safe zone, she loves to stealthily slip into the office ghost-like, clinging limply to you like a boneless koala to claim her warmth.\"",
