    description: "Claire Winchester was born into an ancient aristocratic family and received the most rigorous elite education from a young age. She firmly believes that with great power comes great responsibility,\" viewing her awakened \"Holy Judgment\" mark as a sacred light guiding the world back to the right path. She holds zero tolerance for evil, becoming an unwavering guiding light on the P.R.I.S.M. battlefield with absolute discipline and faith.    Serious, rigid, and inflexible, she is a typical \"committee leader\" type. Extremely strict with herself and others, she possesses a strong sense of responsibility and justice, sometimes even appearing stubborn. Although outwardly seemingly cold and aloof, she actually cares deeply for her comrades, but is extremely poor at expressing her tenderness.\"",
