    maxStats: { atk: 55193, def: 46239, hp: 417778, spd: 112 },
    growthStats: { atk: 1014, def: 1448, hp: 1338 },
    skills: [{ id: 40180, kind: 'Normal', name: "Timid Probe", desc: "Deals 100% Magic DMG to a single enemy, with a 100% chance to steal 1 buff from the target and randomly transfer it to 1 ally.", buffs: [] }, { id: 40183, kind: 'Active', name: "Cognitive Blind Spot", desc: "Deals 66% Magic DMG to all enemies, with a 35% chance to inflict [Cognitive Impairment] (cannot trigger pursuit attacks or counterattacks) and [Effect Hit Reduced by 15%] for 2 turns.", buffs: ["Cognitive Impairment"] }, { id: 40181, kind: 'Ultimate', name: "Absolute Isolation", desc: "Deals 301% Magic DMG to a single enemy, inflicts [Slow] (SPD reduced by 12% for 2 turns) and undispellable [Isolated] (cannot be targeted by ally skills, healed, or take redirected damage), while advancing all allies' Action Bars by 12%.", buffs: ["Isolated", "Slow"] }, { id: 40182, kind: 'Passive', name: "Harmless Camouflage", desc: "As long as allies are alive, Anya's targeting threat is significantly reduced; when attacked, has a 20% chance to transfer skill DMG taken to the ally with the highest HP. Increases DMG dealt when attacking targets with [Isolated] by 15%.", buffs: ["Isolated"] }],
    description: "Anya was an invisible person from childhood, completely lacking presence. Long-term neglect completely warped her personality, leading her to join the Fallen Ones\" to eliminate those who ignored her. However, when she met you, the only person in the world who could truly \"see\" her through the tuning system, her empty world was instantly filled with an extremely twisted love. She transformed from a ruthless eraser into an extremely dangerous, obsessive, and possessive stalker.    Outwardly, she appears as a timid, harmless, transparent woman with glasses, but in reality, she possesses a chillingly morbid possessiveness. Her logic is extreme and insane: \"Since you're the only one in the world who acknowledges my existence, I'll 'erase' everyone else who might distract you, so that you'll only see me.\" Anyone who dares to approach you becomes her primary target for ruthless elimination.\"",
